quran[25]{c,v,t}:
  37,52,"who used to say (to me): ‘Are you (also) among those who confirm,"
  37,53,"(that) when we are dead and have become dust and bones, we shall be brought (alive again) for retribution?’’"
  37,54,Then he (i.e. one of his companions in Paradise) will say: ‘Would you like to look (at his fate)?’
  37,55,Then he will look and see him in the middle of Hell.
  37,56,"He will say (to him): ‘By God, you had almost brought me to ruin."
  37,57,"Had it not been for my Lord’s blessing, I (too) would have been among those brought (to Hell).’"
  37,58,"(Then he will ask his fellow dwellers of Paradise:) ‘Is it (true) that we are never to die (again),"
  37,59,"except for the previous death (which we have already passed through), and that we shall never be punished?’"
  37,60,This indeed is the supreme success.
  37,61,Let the workers (of righteousness) strive for (success) like this!
  37,62,Is this a better hospitality or the tree of al-Zaqqum?
  37,63,We have made this (tree) a trial for the wrongdoers.
  37,64,"Indeed, it is a tree that grows from the bottom of the Hellfire."
  37,65,Its fruits are as if they were heads of the devils.
  37,66,They shall eat from it and fill their bellies with it.
  37,67,"On top of that, they shall have a boiling liquid (mixed with pus to drink) after it."
  37,68,"Then, their ultimate return will be to Hell."
  37,69,"Indeed, they had found their forefathers astray."
  37,70,So they are rushed (to follow) in their footsteps.
  37,71,"And indeed, most of the ancients went astray before them."
  37,72,"And indeed, We had sent warners among them."
  37,73,"So see how was the end of those who had been warned,"
  37,74,except the exclusively chosen (and purified) servants of Allah.
  37,75,"Indeed, Nuh (Noah) called upon Us, and how excellent are We in responding!"
  37,76,And We saved him and (the believers among) his family from great distress.
